<p>The four Ps. Product: three items with clear jobs. Price: three, nine and fourteen euros, value-based, with margins between 57 and 73 percent on estimated costs, to be confirmed with supplier quotes. Place: a campus pop-up, school packs and coastal visitor centres. Promotion: the rankings, videos, games and PDFs we already have.</p>
